{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will follow the journey of Kosmo, a clumsy, rookie space explorer in search of Nova, his robot girlfriend. After a fatal accident, all of Nova\u2019s pieces get scattered in outer space! So now Kosmo wants to retrieve all Nova\u2019s bits, rebuild her, and get back together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636850/extras/6fb07d6b9e50e1307c9bf867124ee9f4.poster.avif?t=1765529393\" width=780 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636850/extras/6fb07d6b9e50e1307c9bf867124ee9f4.webm?t=1765529393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636850/extras/6fb07d6b9e50e1307c9bf867124ee9f4.mp4?t=1765529393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the strangest worlds and planets, full of fantastic aliens, space-time puzzles, and hidden objects to collect. As you complete levels, you will discover Kosmo and Nova\u2019s heartbreaking love story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636850/extras/7fe4faad72171f3572c905c7ca01e180.poster.avif?t=1765529393\" width=780 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636850/extras/7fe4faad72171f3572c905c7ca01e180.webm?t=1765529393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636850/extras/7fe4faad72171f3572c905c7ca01e180.mp4?t=1765529393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Universal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore enigmatic planets full of mind-boggling 